    "detailed_description": "A platform jumping puzzle game,<br />\r\nReasonable use of various abilities of different animals,<br />\r\nKeep the unicorn from falling into the abyss,<br />\r\nFind your way home.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSimple game operation, just choose the direction and jump<br />\r\nRich game experience, plots with different functions constitute unique levels<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSometimes some plots are needed, move or rotate it.<br />\r\nSometimes some plots are not needed, break or move it<br />\r\nSometimes different heights are required, ascend or descend it<br />\r\nIt even sometimes requires bumping to solve puzzles<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnd all it takes is choosing a direction, jumping.<br />\r\nIn short, simple operation and extreme thinking are the core of the game",
